{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Leix7EFhIE1794869074.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>市場對加息預期升溫，金價一度跌至超過一年低位。</p><p></p><p>紐約期金收市報3,853美元一盎司，跌33.3美元，跌幅百分之0.8。現貨金價一度低見3,832.59美元，跌51.9美元，跌幅百分之1.3。</p><p></p><p>Zaner Metals副總裁兼資深金屬策略師格蘭特表示，美國上周公布的通脹數據仍然居高不下，提高市場對下月加息的預期，繼而推高債息及美元，一眾因素對金價構成壓力。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T23:45:14.198429+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T22:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T22:46:36.893760+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T23:38:24.121685+00:00","content_hash":"763a1c968c32821baf5c27498cd93a6e961b7bcca74524a929022ab552498e99","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T23:45:14.198429+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}